 r←Test_Input_Misc_016(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;tips;double;parms;props
⍝ Exercise "Input" with tips.
⍝ Comes with all data types that may actually have a tip.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Time' '' ''DT.Time 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Date' '' ''DT.Date 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Character' '' ''DT.Character 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Numeric' '' ''DT.Numeric 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Currency' '' ''DT.Currency 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'YesNo' '' ''DT.YesNo 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Button' '' ''DT.Button 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Image' ''('file:///',GetFile'KaiJaeger.jpg')DT.Image 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'DropDown' ''('This' 'That' 'More')DT.DropDown 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'DropEdit' ''('One' 'Two' 'Three')DT.DropEdit 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'ListView' ''('Kai' 'Thomas' 'Max')DT.ListView(6 30)1 2
 props←1 2⍴'ListView'(('ColTitles'(,⊂'Names'))('Style' 'Multi'))
 defMat⍪←'Notepad' '' ''DT.Notepad(5 20)1 2
 defMat⍪←'Radio' 'State⋄On⋄off' 0 DT.Radio 0 1 2
 defMat⍪←'Spinner' ''(1 2 3 4)DT.Spinner 0 1 2

 tips←0 2⍴⍬
 double←{⍵(⍵,'_')}
 tips⍪←double'Time'
 tips⍪←double'Date'
 tips⍪←double'Character'
 tips⍪←double'Numeric'
 tips⍪←double'Currency'
 tips⍪←double'YesNo'
 tips⍪←double'Button'
 tips⍪←double'Image'
 tips⍪←double'DropDown'
 tips⍪←double'DropEdit'
 tips⍪←double'ListView'
 tips⍪←double'Notepad'
 tips⍪←double'Radio'
 tips⍪←double'Spinner'

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.tips←tips
 parms.props←props
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat ⍬ parms
 ∆Process n
 n.∆CloseForm

 r←∆OK
